  {
   "id": "the-bridge-curse-2-the-extrication-244573@patch-2024-05-09",
   "gameId": "the-bridge-curse-2-the-extrication-244573",
   "displayName": "RESOLVED: Patch to solve the black screen issue now live",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-05-09T11:17:23.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "A patch is now live, resolving the black screen start-up issue!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Players, please update the game to v1.6.3, which will solve the black screen problem.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We are very sorry for the inconvenience caused to players.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We are currently continuing to resolve audio and voice issues, thank you very much for your patience and understanding.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We've identified a launch issue affecting a small subset of players booting The Bridge Curse 2: The Extraction. Rest assured, we're actively developing a patch to resolve this promptly.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In the interim, to get you back into the game smoothly, we recommend trying these troubleshooting steps.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "For a quick fix, many players have found success by downloading and installing the VP9 Video Extensions available on the Microsoft Store.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Additionally, consider these options",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "1. If you have third-party video player software installed, we advise either uninstalling it or disabling it temporarily.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. For Windows 10 users, ensure your system is updated to at least version 1809.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "3. If your computer has both an independent GPU and a built-in GPU, we recommend disabling the one not in use currently.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We appreciate your patience and understanding as we work to resolve this.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
